      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## About FLUX.2 [klein] 9B\n\n[FLUX.2 [klein]](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8) (Black Forest Labs, 9B, Qwen3 8B text\nencoder): a fast step-distilled text-to-image and editing model. Write full descriptive sentences.\n\n**Settings (distilled, this workflow)**: 4 steps, CFG 1, euler, `Flux2Scheduler`, 1024×1024. The negative conditioning\nis zeroed: at CFG 1 a negative prompt has no effect, so the Generate tab shows none. Raising CFG burns the image.\n\n**Base model** (`flux-2-klein-base-9b-fp8`, undistilled, for LoRA training or true CFG): pick it in\n**Load Diffusion Model**, set steps to 20–30 (Generate tab) and CFG to about 4 (CFGGuider). For a negative prompt,\nreplace **ConditioningZeroOut** with a **CLIP Text Encode** titled `ib:np`.\n\n**Width** and **Height** feed both the latent and the scheduler, whose shift depends on the image size.\n\n## Image Bench\n\nThe node titles carry Image Bench markers:\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | SamplerCustomAdvanced | seed (RandomNoise), steps (Flux2Scheduler), sampling method (KSamplerSelect), CFG scale (CFGGuider), size (Width / Height) |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | — (LoRA exploration only) |\n\n**LoRAs**: check them in the LoRA list of the Generate tab, or type `<lora:name:weight>` into the prompt.\nThe **Image Bench Prompt** node applies them and passes the prompt on without the tags.\n**Load LoRA** stays bypassed; LoRA exploration enables it for its runs and bypasses it again afterwards.\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors) (distilled)\n- [flux-2-klein-base-9b-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-base-9b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-base-9b-fp8.safetensors) (base)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-small-decoder/resolve/main/full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   ├── flux-2-klein-9b-fp8.safetensors\n    │   └── flux-2-klein-base-9b-fp8.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   └── qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── full_encoder_small_decoder.safetensors\n```\n\nFLUX.2 [klein] 9B is released under the FLUX Non-Commercial License.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: FLUX.2 [klein] 9B",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
